# Conventional commit — 50 chars max summary

feat(scope): short summary

Body: what and why (1-3 lines).

Conventions:
- feat: new capability        (e.g. feat(api): fire N8N webhook from /api/run-demo)
- fix: bug fix               (e.g. fix(poller): stop polling after TIMED_OUT)
- docs: README/AI_LOG/etc.
- chore: tooling, deps, CI   (e.g. chore(ci): add multi-arch buildx)
- refactor: no behavior change
- test: tests only

AI pairing note (optional): tag commits made with AI help:
  feat(api): ... (paired with OpenCode)
  fix(ui): ...   (paired with Cursor)
  chore: ...     (manual)

Examples:
  feat(docker): add compose for N8N + Caddy on Oracle ARM
  fix(webhook): secret-gate lead intake endpoint
  docs(ai-log): log session 3 — workflow JSON draft